n_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名人物或待核稱呼保留未解；未補姓名、性別或親屬名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m034-0483","start":483,"end":485,"surface":"荊軻","kind":"person","person_id":"b83_37f_n0v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m034-0491","start":491,"end":493,"surface":"荊軻","kind":"person","person_id":"b83_37f_n0v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m034-0502","start":502,"end":504,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"ao3_0fy_d45_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m034-0512","start":512,"end":514,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"ao3_0fy_d45_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m034-0516","start":516,"end":517,"surface":"軻","kind":"person","person_id":"b83_37f_n0v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m034-0518","start":518,"end":519,"surface":"軻","kind":"person","person_id":"b83_37f_n0v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m034-0523","start":523,"end":524,"surface":"軻","kind":"person","person_id":"b83_37f_n0v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m034-0561","start":561,"end":563,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"e3o_2bk_lhm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m034-0568","start":568,"end":570,"surface":"左右","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名人物或待核稱呼保留未解；未補姓名、性別或親屬名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m034-0573","start":573,"end":574,"surface":"軻","kind":"person","person_id":"b83_37f_n0v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m034-0575","start":575,"end":577,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"ao3_0fy_d45_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m034-0589","start":589,"end":591,"surface":"群臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名人物或待核稱呼保留未解；未補姓名、性別或親屬名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m034-0601","start":601,"end":604,"surface":"夏無且","kind":"person","person_id":"i0f_weg_moh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m034-0613","start":613,"end":615,"surface":"無且","kind":"person","person_id":"i0f_weg_moh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m034-0623","start":623,"end":625,"surface":"荊軻","kind":"person","person_id":"b83_37f_n0v","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-086-cike","book_id":"b-shiji-086","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-086-cike"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p004","text":"自是之後百有餘年，晉悼公使魏絳和戎翟，戎翟朝晉。後百有餘年，趙襄子踰句注而破并代以臨胡貉。其後既與韓魏共滅智伯，分晉地而有之，則趙有代、句注之北，魏有河西、上郡，以與戎界邊。其後義渠之戎築城郭以自守，而秦稍蠶食，至於惠王，遂拔義渠二十五城。惠王擊魏，魏盡入西河及上郡于秦。秦昭王時，義渠戎王與宣太后亂，有二子。宣太后詐而殺義渠戎王於甘泉，遂起兵伐殘義渠。於是秦有隴西、北地、上郡，築長城以拒胡。而趙武靈王亦變俗胡服，習騎射，北破林胡、樓煩。築長城，自代并陰山下，至高闕爲塞。而置雲中、鴈門、代郡。其後燕有賢將秦開，爲質於胡，胡甚信之。歸而襲破走東胡，東胡卻千餘里。與荊軻刺秦王秦舞陽者，開之孫也。燕亦築長城，自造陽至襄平。置上谷、漁陽、右北平、遼西、遼東郡以拒胡。當是之時，冠帶戰國七，而三國邊於匈奴。其後趙將李牧時，匈奴不敢入趙邊。後秦滅六國，而始皇帝使蒙恬將十萬之眾北擊胡，悉收河南地。因河爲塞，築四十四縣城臨河，徙適戍以充之。而通直道，自九原至雲陽，因邊山險塹谿谷可繕者治之，起臨洮至遼東萬餘里。又度河據陽山北假中。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m004-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"晉悼公","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAADAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m004-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"魏絳","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m004-0030","start":30,"end":33,"surface":"趙襄子","kind":"person","person_id":"p4b_qf7_603_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m004-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"智伯","kind":"person","person_id":"fks_8ov_okp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m004-0108","start":108,"end":110,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m004-0120","start":120,"end":122,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAAAAAA","status":"contextual